@startuml
actor User
participant "Web App" as App
participant "API Server" as API
database "Database" as DB

User -> App: Submit Form
activate App

App -> API: POST /data
activate API

note right of API: Validate input

API -> DB: INSERT record
activate DB
DB --> API: OK
deactivate DB

API --> App: 201 Created
deactivate API

App --> User: Show success
deactivate App
@enduml
